        "Title": "The Murderous Multitude of Infection",
        "Location": "LOCATION_HOKKAIDO_FLU",
        "PublicId": "118454629206",
        "ScenePath": "assembly:/_PRO/Scenes/Missions/Hokkaido/_scene_flu.entity",
        "TileImage": "$($repository 4ebdd50b-d38e-46a9-82f9-de25fe8419bb).Image",
        "Description": "47, we come today to Hokkaido, where 4 individuals are in need of elimination.\r\rThese particular 4 are part of an operation to smuggle over 600 varieties of the extremely infectious and lethal Nabazov virus overseas to various terrorist organizations. Microbiologists with the ICA say that if Dr. Liebleid continues to be stingy about the use of the antivirus he has developed, the weaponizers of the virus could wreak havoc on society.\r\rKill them before they have a chance to do such. Good luck, 47.",
